    "findings": [
      {
        "id": "numeric-domain-unresolved",
        "severity": "blocking",
        "message": "The artifact leaves BIN-OPR2:REQ-002 as “all decimal values supported and shown by the calculator” but does not define the supported numeric domain or representation precision. Clarification Q-002 answered “all,” while Q-004 explicitly answered “unknown” for negative/fractional values and repeating binary fractions. An implementation could satisfy the current wording with only a narrow subset of decimal inputs, leaving the clarified all-values scope and its boundary behavior unverifiable. Resolve the numeric domain and fractional representation before treating this clause as fully specified.",
